## How to use this document

When picking up a later-phase item: check whether its trigger has actually
happened before starting. When an item gets done, **mark it done in place,
within the phase it already belongs to** — do not relocate it to Phase 0.
When an item is retired (no longer relevant, as opposed to completed),
strike it through with a one-line note explaining why and when, and move its
full original context to `HISTORY.md` rather than deleting it or letting
this document bloat.
